Z||000015||Chris Schaefer||06-03-2001||08:30 AM||||I wish I could go as I live in south central Connecticut.  However, I have other things that I must do today.  I have to drive towards OOB, ME to drop off the FOCONE's GM Tech-1 for the show in two weeks.<P>So, I will just wait two more weeks for the Fiero Only Show in Old Orchard Beach Maine (June 15,16th).<P>I hope that everyone here can go.  So far we have 35 pre-registered Fieros.  Looks like it will be a record breaking show.<P>I anyone would like more info, please feel free to contact me.<P>Have a good time at the show in RI.<P>Chris Schaefer<BR>FOCONE Membership Director/Editor||||reg||10
